# steps/table-receiver.md §8: a `table:` without `source` builds a table when the program runs; that
# receiver's run-time body is not built yet -- refused in its own words (before: an assignment's words,
# "assignment target must be a declared typed mutable value").
table:
    name: `my.t`
    columns: (@: char a)
    rows:
             x
end: `my.t`
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
